; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-quadratic-quotients.py; checked native terms.
; Quotient equivalence is explicit witnessed divisibility of
; p-q by the monic quadratic, matching AdjoinRoot.mk_eq_mk.
; Evaluation of the difference is proved from the actual ring operations.
(#alias commutative-ring = ./commutative-ring-data.lim::commutative-ring)
